\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 Long, long ago, Lady Sunbringer lifted the very first handful of soil that would become this sky island...\cb1 \
\cb31 Alright, alright. The children have already heard the story of Lady Sunbringer creating Roscaelifer's first island a thousand times over.\cb1 \
\cb31 Today, we're telling the story of the warrior who stood at Lady Sunbringer's side. Clad in moon-bright silver armor, she looked just like an ancient knight from a fairy tale...\cb1 \
