\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 She was Roscaelifer's first soldier, its first spear. She stood on the first front line against the Hollows and led the very first charge.\cb1 \
\cb31 She was the first wing to follow Lady Sunbringer, and with her own hands, she raised Roscaelifer's very first wall.\cb1 \
\cb31 She was Roscaelifer's first blade broken. Her family name was de L'Azur.\cb1 \
\cb31 Like her legend, her descendants burn eternally in the night sky above Roscaelifer.\cb1 \
