\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 Roscaelifer is the miracle of the skies, and the title of those who protect that miracle has never belonged to only a select few.\cb1 \
\cb31 Yet someone must lead those guardians. That was originally Lady Lindverne's duty, but with her bright and carefree nature, she was hardly suited to be a commanding general.\cb1 \
\cb31 Fortunately, she had a dashing deputy. More accurately, she had one after another.\cb1 \
