\fs18 \cf4 \cb31 \strokec4 The soldiers and civilians couldn't help comparing the newly appointed Deputy Administrative Director to her predecessor. Who can blame them? After all, according to Lady Lindverne Sunbringer, every head of House de L'Azur was a legendary figure.\cb1 \
\cb31 Because of that, everyone expected the young de L'Azur to surpass the last, proving worthy of the legendary guardian family's name.\cb1 \
\cb31 And so Lindverne continued weaving new, even more groundbreaking legends for Sigrid.\cb1 \
